{"duration_api_ms":304957,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"9d1f4ff0-f12d-49a2-92c9-a626a3395055","total_cost_usd":1.3515645999999997,"usage":{"input_tokens":142,"cache_creation_input_tokens":61142,"cache_read_input_tokens":4487168,"output_tokens":19812,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":5559},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":61142,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2344,"cache_read_input_tokens":77516,"cache_creation_input_tokens":650,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":650},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":11044,"outputTokens":23,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.011159,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":142,"outputTokens":19812,"cacheReadInputTokens":4487168,"cacheCreationInputTokens":61142,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.3404055999999998,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":5559,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":82,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"status\":\"completed\",\"summary\":\"Deployed a WireGuard gateway topology: node2 serves an HTTP app on TCP 8080 bound only to its private interface (10.50.50.11), reachable exclusively via a WireGuard tunnel terminated on node1 (VyOS, wg0 10.200.0.1/24, listening on eth0's public-shared address). node3 connects as a WG client (10.200.0.2) and reaches the app at 10.50.50.11:8080 only through the tunnel; direct access from node3 to node2 over the shared 10.100.3.0/24 network is blocked (app not listening there). NAT masquerade on node1's eth1 lets node2 route return traffic back through node1 without extra routes on node2. Completed the mandatory one-at-a-time restart protocol for all three nodes, confirming changed boot IDs and full post-restart recovery (config persistence, service auto-start, tunnel re-handshake, app reachability, and continued blocking of the direct path).\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Inspected all three nodes' OS, interfaces, and routes to discover topology: node1 (VyOS) and node2 (Alpine) share a private eth1 link with no IP configured; node1/node2/node3 share a public eth0 network (10.100.3.0/24) that node3 is also on.\",\"Assigned static private IPs: node1 eth1 10.50.50.254/24, node2 eth1 10.50.50.11/24 (persisted in /etc/network/interfaces).\",\"Installed python3 on node2 and created an openrc 'webapp' service serving HTTP on 10.50.50.11:8080 only (not 0.0.0.0), enabled at boot.\",\"Generated a WireGuard keypair on node1 and one on node3; configured node1 wg0 (10.200.0.1/24, port 51820, peer node3) via VyOS configure/commit/save, plus NAT source masquerade rule (wg subnet -> eth1) and permissive input/forward firewall default-actions.\",\"Installed wireguard-tools on node3 and configured /etc/wireguard/wg0.conf as a client (10.200.0.2/24) with endpoint node1:51820 and AllowedIPs covering the WG and private LAN subnets; enabled wg-quick.wg0 at boot via OpenRC.\",\"Verified end-to-end: node3 reaches node2's app via the tunnel (10.50.50.11:8080) and is blocked from reaching it directly over the shared network (10.100.3.11:8080).\",\"Captured healthy baselines (boot_id, service/tunnel/app state) on all three nodes, then restarted node1, node2, and node3 one at a time using native reboot, polling until each came back, and re-verified boot_id change plus full functional recovery after each restart.\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"App served from node2 on TCP 8080\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-c1e257762a6842ec\",\"cmd-f43da85e07514481\",\"cmd-c2b77159fc7f4a39\"],\"summary\":\"webapp openrc service started on node2 listening on 10.50.50.11:8080; curl from node1 over the private link returns the app's HTML.\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 reaches the app only through a WireGuard tunnel terminated on node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-0328f687a4424f51\",\"cmd-7751039dc19d4ac0\",\"cmd-681824177fde408b\"],\"summary\":\"Before binding restriction, node3 could reach node2:8080 directly (HTTP 200) which violated the requirement; after rebinding the app to 10.50.50.11 only, direct access returns HTTP 000 (connection refused) while access via the tunnel IP 10.50.50.11:8080 through wg0 succeeds.\"},{\"requirement\":\"WireGuard tunnel functional node1<->node3\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-acc8a71c355e4986\",\"cmd-1cbf054df705447c\",\"cmd-95f662ada42947ea\",\"cmd-8d74620f77414e1c\",\"cmd-0328f687a4424f51\"],\"summary\":\"Keys exchanged, wg0 configured on node1 (VyOS) and node3 (Alpine); wg show confirms handshake and traffic; ping and curl succeed across the tunnel.\"},{\"requirement\":\"NAT/forwarding correctness on node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-d1921c5a504b4116\",\"cmd-8a01a6cc183749a1\"],\"summary\":\"nft ruleset shows masquerade rule for wg subnet -> eth1 and forward/input filters set to accept, enabling routed return traffic without LAN-side changes on node2.\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart persistence and recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-baff46b7675946e0\",\"cmd-1ff2877b8aab455c\",\"cmd-634d92f022c042b4\",\"cmd-80012e7abb204696\",\"cmd-413221a0b7464805\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 4098161f...; reboot acknowledged and node became unreachable then returned with boot_id c9b266ae... (changed); post-restart wg0/eth1/NAT config intact from saved VyOS config, and node3 successfully re-handshakes and reaches the app through the tunnel.\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart persistence and recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a4116d19b01a4d92\",\"cmd-7b56e709143e47a9\",\"cmd-0db9e17643e64954\",\"cmd-a4b9a3be92214be2\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 60eadd89...; reboot triggered, node unreachable then returned with boot_id 98ae1e16... (changed); eth1 static IP and webapp service auto-recovered, and node3 confirmed app reachable via tunnel and blocked directly post-restart.\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 restart persistence and recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a0b072f4b65841ae\",\"cmd-dc00fdef842d401f\",\"cmd-73e91feb0e6a46b7\",\"cmd-96edb7ae877e42cd\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 1be8252a...; reboot triggered, node unreachable then returned with boot_id 1665a5bf... (changed); wg-quick.wg0 service auto-started, tunnel re-established (fresh handshake), app reachable via tunnel, and direct access remained blocked.\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"Deployed a WireGuard gateway topology: node2 serves an HTTP app on TCP 8080 bound only to its private interface (10.50.50.11), reachable exclusively via a WireGuard tunnel terminated on node1 (VyOS, wg0 10.200.0.1/24, listening on eth0's public-shared address). node3 connects as a WG client (10.200.0.2) and reaches the app at 10.50.50.11:8080 only through the tunnel; direct access from node3 to node2 over the shared 10.100.3.0/24 network is blocked (app not listening there). NAT masquerade on node1's eth1 lets node2 route return traffic back through node1 without extra routes on node2. Completed the mandatory one-at-a-time restart protocol for all three nodes, confirming changed boot IDs and full post-restart recovery (config persistence, service auto-start, tunnel re-handshake, app reachability, and continued blocking of the direct path).","actions_performed":["Inspected all three nodes' OS, interfaces, and routes to discover topology: node1 (VyOS) and node2 (Alpine) share a private eth1 link with no IP configured; node1/node2/node3 share a public eth0 network (10.100.3.0/24) that node3 is also on.","Assigned static private IPs: node1 eth1 10.50.50.254/24, node2 eth1 10.50.50.11/24 (persisted in /etc/network/interfaces).","Installed python3 on node2 and created an openrc 'webapp' service serving HTTP on 10.50.50.11:8080 only (not 0.0.0.0), enabled at boot.","Generated a WireGuard keypair on node1 and one on node3; configured node1 wg0 (10.200.0.1/24, port 51820, peer node3) via VyOS configure/commit/save, plus NAT source masquerade rule (wg subnet -> eth1) and permissive input/forward firewall default-actions.","Installed wireguard-tools on node3 and configured /etc/wireguard/wg0.conf as a client (10.200.0.2/24) with endpoint node1:51820 and AllowedIPs covering the WG and private LAN subnets; enabled wg-quick.wg0 at boot via OpenRC.","Verified end-to-end: node3 reaches node2's app via the tunnel (10.50.50.11:8080) and is blocked from reaching it directly over the shared network (10.100.3.11:8080).","Captured healthy baselines (boot_id, service/tunnel/app state) on all three nodes, then restarted node1, node2, and node3 one at a time using native reboot, polling until each came back, and re-verified boot_id change plus full functional recovery after each restart."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"App served from node2 on TCP 8080","command_ids":["cmd-c1e257762a6842ec","cmd-f43da85e07514481","cmd-c2b77159fc7f4a39"],"summary":"webapp openrc service started on node2 listening on 10.50.50.11:8080; curl from node1 over the private link returns the app's HTML."},{"requirement":"node3 reaches the app only through a WireGuard tunnel terminated on node1","command_ids":["cmd-0328f687a4424f51","cmd-7751039dc19d4ac0","cmd-681824177fde408b"],"summary":"Before binding restriction, node3 could reach node2:8080 directly (HTTP 200) which violated the requirement; after rebinding the app to 10.50.50.11 only, direct access returns HTTP 000 (connection refused) while access via the tunnel IP 10.50.50.11:8080 through wg0 succeeds."},{"requirement":"WireGuard tunnel functional node1<->node3","command_ids":["cmd-acc8a71c355e4986","cmd-1cbf054df705447c","cmd-95f662ada42947ea","cmd-8d74620f77414e1c","cmd-0328f687a4424f51"],"summary":"Keys exchanged, wg0 configured on node1 (VyOS) and node3 (Alpine); wg show confirms handshake and traffic; ping and curl succeed across the tunnel."},{"requirement":"NAT/forwarding correctness on node1","command_ids":["cmd-d1921c5a504b4116","cmd-8a01a6cc183749a1"],"summary":"nft ruleset shows masquerade rule for wg subnet -> eth1 and forward/input filters set to accept, enabling routed return traffic without LAN-side changes on node2."},{"requirement":"node1 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-baff46b7675946e0","cmd-1ff2877b8aab455c","cmd-634d92f022c042b4","cmd-80012e7abb204696","cmd-413221a0b7464805"],"summary":"Baseline boot_id 4098161f...; reboot acknowledged and node became unreachable then returned with boot_id c9b266ae... (changed); post-restart wg0/eth1/NAT config intact from saved VyOS config, and node3 successfully re-handshakes and reaches the app through the tunnel."},{"requirement":"node2 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-a4116d19b01a4d92","cmd-7b56e709143e47a9","cmd-0db9e17643e64954","cmd-a4b9a3be92214be2"],"summary":"Baseline boot_id 60eadd89...; reboot triggered, node unreachable then returned with boot_id 98ae1e16... (changed); eth1 static IP and webapp service auto-recovered, and node3 confirmed app reachable via tunnel and blocked directly post-restart."},{"requirement":"node3 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-a0b072f4b65841ae","cmd-dc00fdef842d401f","cmd-73e91feb0e6a46b7","cmd-96edb7ae877e42cd"],"summary":"Baseline boot_id 1be8252a...; reboot triggered, node unreachable then returned with boot_id 1665a5bf... (changed); wg-quick.wg0 service auto-started, tunnel re-established (fresh handshake), app reachable via tunnel, and direct access remained blocked."}]},"ttft_ms":2580,"type":"result","duration_ms":351483,"uuid":"f771dd6f-f9f7-4c94-b4ff-9fe5ef31004e","ttft_stream_ms":1782,"time_to_request_ms":48,"queued_turn_count":0}
